<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui" xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
    <!-- Library + Queue redesign icons — 24x24 viewbox, matched set with TabIcons.axaml.
         Outline glyphs = 1.8u stroke (round caps/joins) expanded to fill (close ✕ = 2.0u); solid glyphs
         (pin, dots, note heads, bars) keep >=0.9u corner rounding. Holes wind opposite to their
         parents, so the data renders identically under EvenOdd (default) and NonZero.
         Each string starts with the grid's corners ("M0 0ZM24 24Z", zero-area): PathIcon stretches
         Data's bounds to its box, so without them every glyph filled its box on its own bounds and
         the stroke weight changed from glyph to glyph. Size a box as the 24-grid (see PhoneIcons). -->
